{
  "layout": "oz_vpp_pane_news",
  "note": "Ядро › Новини (VPP rework 2026-11-12, design §5.1; artboard CoreNews): the form on the left -- title, text with a live byte counter against the bridge's 1000-byte ceiling, the signature cycler (your own name, then every persona the bridge lists for you), publish and clear; in the middle the post as a PDA will show it, in the PDA's own blue (the vppPda* tokens, a shade off the series colours so OZ_VppPaint leaves them alone); on the right the place of the recent posts, which the bridge keeps and the core does not. Created by OZ_VppMenu.OnCreate; the shell moves it into the content area. Laid out at the content size of the default window (1060 x 680); a smaller window cuts it at the edge. Names NwTitle, NwBody, NwBytes, NwBytesText, BtnNwWho, BtnNwPost, BtnNwClear, NwPrevTitle, NwPrevWho and NwPrevBody are read by OZ_VppMenu.c.",
  "root": {
    "frame": {
      "name": "PaneNews",
      "size": "$vpp.content",
      "at": [0, "$vpp.paneY"],
      "hidden": true,
      "priority": 2,
      "note": "Hidden: ShowPane shows the open page and hides the rest.",
      "children": [
        {
          "vbox": {
            "name": "NwBody0",
            "size": "fill",
            "children": [
              {
                "frame": {
                  "name": "NwHead",
                  "h": 60,
                  "children": [
                    {"label": {"name": "NwHeadTitle", "at": [24, 9], "size": [520, 26], "text": "#STR_OZ_VPP_NW_HEAD", "font": "title", "color": "$vppText"}},
                    {"label": {"name": "NwHeadSub", "at": [24, 35], "size": [760, 18], "text": "#STR_OZ_VPP_NW_SUB", "font": "small", "color": "$vppMuted"}},
                    {"panel": {"name": "NwHeadRule", "at": [0, 59], "size": [1060, 1], "color": "$vppEdge"}}
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "hbox": {
                  "name": "NwCols",
                  "h": "fill",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "panel": {
                        "name": "NwLeft",
                        "w": 440,
                        "color": "$vppPanel",
                        "inset": 16,
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "vbox": {
                              "name": "NwForm",
                              "size": "fill",
                              "gap": 8,
                              "children": [
                                {"label": {"name": "NwFormHead", "h": 24, "text": "#STR_OZ_VPP_NW_NEW", "font": "header", "color": "$vppText"}},
                                {"label": {"name": "NwTitleLbl", "h": 18, "text": "#STR_OZ_VPP_NW_TITLE_LBL", "font": "small", "color": "$vppMuted"}},
                                {"field": {"name": "NwTitle", "color": "$vppText"}},
                                {"label": {"name": "NwBodyLbl", "h": 18, "text": "#STR_OZ_VPP_NW_BODY_LBL", "font": "small", "color": "$vppMuted"}},
                                {"field": {"name": "NwBody", "h": 190, "lines": 9, "color": "$vppText", "note": "No wrap on purpose: every break the engine makes is a real line break in the text, and the post would carry them to Discord."}},
                                {
                                  "hbox": {
                                    "name": "NwBytesRow",
                                    "h": 18,
                                    "gap": 10,
                                    "children": [
                                      {"bar": {"name": "NwBytes", "w": "fill", "h": 4, "track": "$vppRaised", "fill": "$vppAccent", "note": "The text's bytes against the ceiling: OZ_VppMenu.NwPaint widens NwBytesFill."}},
                                      {"label": {"name": "NwBytesText", "w": 150, "text": "", "font": "small", "color": "$vppText", "align": "right"}}
                                    ]
                                  }
                                },
                                {"text": {"name": "NwBytesNote", "h": 34, "plain": true, "grow": false, "font": "small", "color": "$vppMuted", "text": "#STR_OZ_VPP_NW_BYTES_NOTE"}},
                                {"label": {"name": "NwWhoLbl", "h": 18, "text": "#STR_OZ_VPP_NW_WHO_LBL", "font": "small", "color": "$vppMuted"}},
                                {"button": {"name": "BtnNwWho", "text": "", "font": "small", "bg": "$vppCell", "edge": "$vppEdge", "color": "$vppText", "note": "Cycles the signature: your own name, then every persona the bridge lists for you (news_voices)."}},
                                {"text": {"name": "NwWhoNote", "h": 34, "plain": true, "grow": false, "font": "small", "color": "$vppMuted", "text": "#STR_OZ_VPP_NW_WHO_NOTE"}},
                                {"gap": {"h": "fill"}},
                                {
                                  "hbox": {
                                    "name": "NwActions",
                                    "h": 34,
                                    "gap": 10,
                                    "children": [
                                      {"button": {"name": "BtnNwPost", "w": "fill", "h": 34, "text": "#STR_OZ_VPP_NW_POST", "font": "small", "bg": "$vppAccent", "edge": "$vppAccent", "color": "$vppText"}},
                                      {"button": {"name": "BtnNwClear", "w": 130, "h": 34, "text": "#STR_OZ_VPP_NW_CLEAR", "font": "small", "bg": "$vppRaised", "edge": "$vppEdge", "color": "$vppText"}}
                                    ]
                                  }
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    },
                    {"panel": {"name": "NwRuleA", "w": 1, "color": "$vppEdge"}},
                    {
                      "panel": {
                        "name": "NwMid",
                        "w": 340,
                        "color": "$vppPanel",
                        "inset": 16,
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "vbox": {
                              "name": "NwPrevCol",
                              "size": "fill",
                              "gap": 10,
                              "children": [
                                {"label": {"name": "NwPrevTag", "h": 18, "text": "#STR_OZ_VPP_NW_PREVIEW", "font": "small", "color": "$vppMuted"}},
                                {
                                  "panel": {
                                    "name": "NwCard",
                                    "h": 300,
                                    "color": "$vppPdaGround",
                                    "inset": 14,
                                    "children": [
                                      {
                                        "vbox": {
                                          "name": "NwCardCol",
                                          "size": "fill",
                                          "gap": 6,
                                          "children": [
                                            {
                                              "hbox": {
                                                "name": "NwCardHead",
                                                "h": 18,
                                                "children": [
                                                  {"label": {"name": "NwCardKind", "w": "fill", "text": "#STR_OZ_VPP_NW_CARD_KIND", "font": "small", "color": "$vppPdaAccent"}},
                                                  {"label": {"name": "NwCardNew", "w": 80, "text": "#STR_OZ_VPP_NW_CARD_NEW", "font": "small", "color": "$vppPdaAccent", "align": "right"}}
                                                ]
                                              }
                                            },
                                            {"panel": {"name": "NwCardRule", "h": 1, "color": "$vppPdaEdge"}},
                                            {"text": {"name": "NwPrevTitle", "h": 44, "plain": true, "grow": false, "font": "header", "color": "$vppPdaText", "text": ""}},
                                            {"label": {"name": "NwPrevWho", "h": 18, "text": "", "font": "small", "color": "$vppPdaMuted"}},
                                            {"text": {"name": "NwPrevBody", "h": "fill", "plain": true, "grow": false, "font": "small", "color": "$vppPdaText", "text": ""}}
                                          ]
                                        }
                                      }
                                    ]
                                  }
                                },
                                {"text": {"name": "NwPrevNote", "h": 52, "plain": true, "grow": false, "font": "small", "color": "$vppMuted", "text": "#STR_OZ_VPP_NW_PREVIEW_NOTE"}}
                              ]
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    },
                    {"panel": {"name": "NwRuleB", "w": 1, "color": "$vppEdge"}},
                    {
                      "panel": {
                        "name": "NwRight",
                        "w": "fill",
                        "color": "$vppHead",
                        "inset": 16,
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "vbox": {
                              "name": "NwRecentCol",
                              "size": "fill",
                              "gap": 8,
                              "children": [
                                {"label": {"name": "NwRecentHead", "h": 24, "text": "#STR_OZ_VPP_NW_RECENT", "font": "header", "color": "$vppText"}},
                                {"text": {"name": "NwRecentNote", "h": 170, "plain": true, "grow": false, "font": "small", "color": "$vppMuted", "text": "#STR_OZ_VPP_NW_RECENT_NOTE", "note": "The bridge keeps the posts (v1/news/list), the core keeps none: no list here until the core learns to ask the bridge for it."}}
                              ]
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
